---
/* spring-fest.html — section 3 of 10.

   Same markup contract as hallucia/Plans.astro: [data-plans] with one
   .plan per package, each carrying the plan id that
   scripts/features/plan-picker.js and features/booking.js look up in
   AS.plans, and a [data-lock] bar the picker rewrites as you choose.

   No "travelling from" selector here, unlike Hallucia and Mood Indigo.
   On those the fare moves with your state because travel is inside the
   price. On Spring Fest it is not — the fare is the same from
   everywhere and your train is yours — so a selector would ask a
   question that changes nothing. */
---

<section class="sec s-paper2" id="plans">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="slug"><b>02</b><span>Pick your plan</span><span class="ln"></span><span class="m hide-s">Early bird · first 30</span></p>
    <div class="split end">
      <div class="stack"><h2 class="d-l" data-split>The fest, <span class="it">or the fest and the sea</span></h2>
        <p class="body">₹2,499 locks your seat on either plan, the rest is due by 22 December, 30 days before the fest</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-48">
      <div class="plans" data-plans><label class="plan" data-id="sf5" for="plan-sf5" data-cursor="Pick">
  <input type="radio" name="trip-plan" id="plan-sf5" value="sf5">
  <div class="plan-top"><span class="plan-tag">Plan 01 · 5D / 4N</span><span class="plan-tick" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
  <h3>The trip</h3><p>Five days at Spring Fest, 21 to 25 January</p><ul><li>Pickup and drop, Howrah or Kharagpur</li><li>Four nights, IIT KGP hostel</li><li>All meals</li><li>Spring Fest pass, all three fest days</li><li>Trip captain</li></ul><a class="plan-doc" href="/assets/docs/spring-fest-5-day-brochure.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor="Open">Brochure ↓</a>
  <div class="plan-price"><b class="tabular">₹4,999</b><s class="tabular">₹7,499</s><small>per person, early bird, first 30</small></div>
</label><label class="plan" data-id="sf6" for="plan-sf6" data-cursor="Pick">
  <input type="radio" name="trip-plan" id="plan-sf6" value="sf6">
  <div class="plan-top"><span class="plan-tag">Plan 02 · 6D / 5N</span><span class="plan-tick" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
  <h3>Trip + Ocean</h3><p>The same fest, then two days by road to the Bay of Bengal</p><ul><li>Everything in Plan 01</li><li>Digha, Tajpur and Mandarmani</li><li>A night at a beach resort</li><li>Private road transport</li><li>Drop at Howrah Junction on the 26th</li></ul><a class="plan-doc" href="/assets/docs/spring-fest-6-day-brochure.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor="Open">Brochure ↓</a>
  <div class="plan-price"><b class="tabular">₹7,999</b><small>per person</small></div>
</label></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lock-bar" data-lock><span>Spring Fest · ₹4,999</span><a class="btn btn-acid" href="apply.html#sf5" data-cursor="Go">Get your spot<span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <p class="fine mt-24">₹4,999 is the early-bird price on the 5-day plan for the first 30 registrations, then it is ₹7,499. Either plan is ₹2,499 to book and the balance by 22 December. Your train or flight to Howrah or Kharagpur is not in the price, but we handle train and flight support for colleges, clubs and solo travellers, tell us your city and group size</p>
  </div>
</section>
